## Docker

```bash
make docker-build
make docker-run
```

Or directly:

```bash
docker build -t {{.AppName}} .
docker run --rm -p {{.Port}}:{{.Port}} {{.AppName}}
```

The container runs as an unprivileged user, and Docker's health check calls `/health`.
